{"name":"The Rawwalk Sign","slug":"glyph-rawwalk-sign","blurb":"On the census street, Remy carries the sign toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Rawwalk. Click the sign and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Rawwalk Sign.","seal":"d2721c63f6bbd3a973676a7637f2cbd4cf58070ff28dcb4bd49a37555dc047b4"}
